WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:04.530
Tunatakiwa kutia kivuli 20% ya huu mraba hapa.

00:04.530 --> 00:06.700
Kabla ya kufanya hivyo, kwanza tujiulize

00:06.700 --> 00:08.380
nini maana ya asilimia.

00:08.380 --> 00:09.440
Ngoja niiandike tena.

00:09.440 --> 00:15.890
20% ni sawa na --ninaandika kwa maneno--asilimia 20

00:15.890 --> 00:26.260
ambayo inamaanisha asilimia 20

00:26.260 --> 00:30.380
Na kama unafahamu neno karne unaweza

00:30.380 --> 00:33.940
kufahamu kwamba senti imetokana na neno la kilatini

00:33.940 --> 00:36.820
likimaanisha mia moja.

00:36.820 --> 00:39.230
Hii inamaanisha unaweza kutoa senti na maana yake ni

00:39.230 --> 00:40.700
ni 100.

00:40.700 --> 00:49.610
Kwa hiyo hii ni sawa na 20 ya 100.

00:49.610 --> 00:53.970
Kama unataka kutia kivuli 20%, hii inamaanisha kama ukiugawanya mraba

00:53.970 --> 00:57.880
katika vipande 100, tunataka kutia kivuli vipande 20 kati ya vyote.

00:57.880 --> 00:59.130
20 ya 100.

00:59.130 --> 01:01.240
Kwa hiyo kuna miraba mingapi hapa?

01:01.240 --> 01:05.970
Kama tukienda kwa mlalo tuna miraba moja, mbili, tatu.

01:05.970 --> 01:09.400
nne, tano, sita, saba, nane, tisa, kumi.

01:09.400 --> 01:13.450
Na kama tukienda kwa wima, tuna moja, mbili, tatu nne, tano,

01:13.450 --> 01:15.630
sita, saba, nane, tisa, kumi,

01:15.630 --> 01:17.620
kwa hiyo huu ni mraba wa 10 kwa 10.

01:17.620 --> 01:21.680
Kwa hiyo lina miraba 100 hapa.

01:21.680 --> 01:24.580
Njia nyingine ya kusema kuwa huu mraba ni mkubwa zaidi

01:24.580 --> 01:26.270
ni mraba ambao tunaouongelea.

01:26.270 --> 01:31.970
Huu mraba mkubwa umegawanywa katika miraba midogo 100,

01:31.970 --> 01:34.220
kwa hiyo umeshagawanywa kwa 100.

01:34.220 --> 01:38.990
Kwa hiyo kama tunataka kutia kivuli 20% yake, tunatakiwa kutia kivuli

01:38.990 --> 01:42.420
miraba yote iliyogawanywa kwa 100.

01:42.420 --> 01:45.470
Kwa hili hapa tutatia kivuli miraba 20.

01:45.470 --> 01:47.330
Ngoja nitie kivuli mmoja.

01:47.330 --> 01:51.210
Kwa hiyo nimetia kivuli mraba mmoja,

01:51.210 --> 01:54.050
nimetia kivuli mraba mmoja kati ya 100.

01:54.050 --> 01:56.080
100 kati ya 100 itakuwa kitu kizima.

01:56.080 --> 01:58.640
Nimetia kivuli mmoja tu.

01:58.640 --> 02:02.170
Huu mraba mmoja utakuwa ni 1%.

02:02.170 --> 02:04.300
ya mraba mkubwa wote.

02:04.300 --> 02:08.009
Kama ningetakiwa kutia kivuli mwingine,

02:08.009 --> 02:12.190
basi itakuwa 2%

02:12.190 --> 02:12.950
ya umbo lote.

02:12.950 --> 02:15.680
Yaani 2 ya 100, ambayo 100

02:15.680 --> 02:16.640
ni umbo lote.

02:16.640 --> 02:23.490
Kama tunataka kutia kivuli 20, tunahesabua moja, mbili, tatu, nne--

02:23.490 --> 02:26.860
kama tukitia kivuli mstari wote itakuwa 10% au siyo?

02:26.860 --> 02:34.160
moja, mbili, tatu, nne, tano, sita, saba, nane, tisa, kumi.

02:34.160 --> 02:36.430
Na tunataka kutia kivuli 20, kwa hiyo itabidi tuongeze safu nyingine.

02:36.430 --> 02:39.050
Kwa hiyo nitatia kivuli hii safu nyingine wote hapa.

02:39.050 --> 02:43.460
Kisha nitakuwa nimetia kivuli miraba 20 ya 100.

02:43.460 --> 02:45.010
au namna nyingine ya kufanya ni

02:45.010 --> 02:48.750
kuchukua mraba mkubwa kabisa na kuugawanya katika vipande 100 vilivyo sawa ambavyo nimevitia kivuli

02:48.750 --> 02:57.590
20 kati ya 100, au 20% kati ya mraba wote mkubwa.

02:57.590 --> 02:59.720
Natumai imeleta maana.
